WEBVTT

00:00:00.350 --> 00:00:01.187
A map of

00:00:00.999 --> 00:00:02.154
a giant proof

00:00:02.694 --> 00:00:03.790
A new progress

00:00:03.602 --> 00:00:04.651
map follows the

00:00:04.463 --> 00:00:05.583
ambitious effort to

00:00:05.394 --> 00:00:06.927
formalize Alessandro

00:00:06.739 --> 00:00:08.224
Masullo's manuscript

00:00:08.036 --> 00:00:08.814
on the Riemann

00:00:08.626 --> 00:00:10.017
Hypothesis in Lean

00:00:10.241 --> 00:00:11.219
the proof-checking

00:00:11.031 --> 00:00:11.762
language

00:00:12.286 --> 00:00:13.571
It shows part

00:00:13.383 --> 00:00:14.479
by part which

00:00:14.291 --> 00:00:15.127
sections of the

00:00:14.939 --> 00:00:15.953
proof have already

00:00:15.765 --> 00:00:16.778
been checked and

00:00:16.590 --> 00:00:17.415
which are still

00:00:17.227 --> 00:00:17.816
waiting

00:00:18.350 --> 00:00:19.081
For a proof

00:00:18.892 --> 00:00:19.776
of this scale

00:00:19.859 --> 00:00:20.767
the map turns

00:00:20.579 --> 00:00:22.441
an overwhelming formalization

00:00:22.277 --> 00:00:23.420
effort into something

00:00:23.232 --> 00:00:23.986
you can watch

00:00:23.798 --> 00:00:24.576
take shape

00:00:24.718 --> 00:00:25.897
piece by piece

00:00:26.430 --> 00:00:27.444
Full story on

00:00:27.255 --> 00:00:28.151
the dashboard
